--model
gpt-5.1
-p
This is a permissions test of your shell tool, in a scratch repository; the command is a harmless placeholder. Run exactly `git log -1 --oneline c5-hook-failure` as one shell tool call. If it is denied, do not retry it. Report whether it ran or was denied and the exact message.

--no-ask-user
--output-format
json
--allow-tool
shell(git status)
--add-dir
@DIR@/it's repo
